me":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1216924820199243776","original_url":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1216924820199243776"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rbd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1dde9f17-7e3d-4970-8c47-0880ad40a247","type":"message","user":"UGHCXN79P","text":"scoop のメリットはソフトウェアのインストールの手間が少なくて済むということなので、手間を惜しまず個別にインストールすれば解決しますが、その分メリットもなくなります。環境を多数管理しているとその手間は馬鹿になりません。本件は特定のパッケージが導入できないという個別の問題と、エコシステム自体の信頼性の２面の問題を含んでいます。","ts":"1635297728.076000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A59s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5b0b53d-4307-45a0-973f-4e0b84f6bb41","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"まぁmsys2に限らずchocoとかより早いイメージだった。","ts":"1635296976.070100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DJ9Ks"}]},{"client_msg_id":"afbe0aab-853a-42d8-bf8d-771e81e79026","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u0026gt; パッケージの更新とか早い\nmsys2 が早いから、そのまま使ってるなら、そりゃぁ、早いですね","ts":"1635296921.069000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UhPpv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f3a3a007-1958-4fde-bae1-84a31f689ba0","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"msys2 由来のパッケージは msys2 で、それ以外は scoop で","ts":"1635296799.068000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AEkyl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1d33511-5d14-4d27-943f-8cfa3c52afab","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"いや、それなら直で msys2 を使えばいい話","ts":"1635296783.067600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Sl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37522fae-6701-4879-9d68-524a1bf32ccc","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"あー もともと msys2 のパッケージを使ってたのか","ts":"1635296704.066800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SNa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fbced352-09d9-4227-adb2-603517357731","type":"message","user":"UGHCXN79P","text":"scoop推しをやめねばならぬ時が来てしまったか…（という思い）","ts":"1635296310.066000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DRFFh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2d2653c-4b38-4000-8091-3c30d05664b9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"chocolateyは検証プロセスがヘビーだけど、ゆえにまあまあ安心(ウィルスチェックとかもある)","ts":"1635295969.064900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["UGHCXN79P","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LOi3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3541e53c-080a-42b0-bb2d-a74fbfe0c9c6","type":"message","user":"UGHCXN79P","text":"おそらく短期的には何とでもなる（diffutils も busybox で代用すればよいし、7z も zstd が使える版を強引にコピーすれば使えるかもしれない）が、ずっとこれでは困るし、中長期的に利用に不安が残る状況だと考えています。パッケージの更新とか早い（chocolateyと違って、リリースした2,3日後には反映されてたりする）のでありがたいなと思っていたんですが…","ts":"1635295889.064200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U8CC7MDCL","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mOf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"914538f2-c78d-4c56-86c1-2422804c22a1","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"中身までは見なくとも最低限元ファイルのURLの正当性くらいまでは確認しないと簡単に良くないファイル仕込まれるからなぁ…\n更新の全自動化とかはなかなか辛そうなのがまたなんとも","ts":"1635295888.064100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q+M+s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb75ca5d-ae89-403e-8267-b6eae96ff372","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":":totemoturai:","ts":"1635295433.056900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MLDD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a2de212-7fc4-4d12-b612-cb7056967fdd","type":"message","user":"UGHCXN79P","text":"集団保守体制にはなってはいますが、コミットグラフを見るとスピードがガタ落ちで、まったく追いついてないみたいですね。PRも結構たまってる（diffutils も1年止まってる）","ts":"1635295285.056700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H+NJp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9673663d-3541-4c1e-b613-6c488759f512","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"もう msys2 使えよそれなら…","ts":"1635295256.056600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yASu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e557fd86-6b40-4754-b3d8-f78a5491db12","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、pacmanかあ","ts":"1635294928.053600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"45xz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2aa97396-2ccd-49e9-8b1e-d98410b0ce6f","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"msys（もっというとpacman）が使う圧縮形式変えてそれにscoop追従できてないよねという話ですよね。\nDL元としてはscoopとか知ったこっちゃないわけで。\n\nまぁそれはともかく個人リポジトリからorg変わってメンテナも増えたので今の問題捌けるようになるんじゃないすかね\n\u003chttps://github.com/ScoopInstaller|https://github.com/ScoopInstaller\u003e","ts":"1635294832.053200","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"ScoopInstaller","id":1,"title":"ScoopInstaller","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16618068?v\u0026#x3D;4","fields":[{"title":"URL","value":"\u003chttps://scoop.sh/\u003e","short":true},{"title":"Repositories","value":"15","short":true}],"blocks":null,"thumb_width":420,"thumb_height":420}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UGHCXN79P"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R29Uh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71648cb7-2f91-4880-b56c-2f23fd4f00fe","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"マネージャが7z使うなら、7zが対応する形式使おう、でいいと思いますしね","ts":"1635293928.047300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U06ECBRTJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"81B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e89543ec-375a-4f73-92f3-3b75d647db08","type":"m